  <section id="lifespan" data-section-label="How long a Staffy lives">
    <h2>{T(heading('lifespan'))}</h2>
    <p>
      This is the question behind all the others on the page, and the answer is a range rather
      than a number. Everything above decides where in it a dog lands.
    </p>
    <img
      class="bl-img"
      src={kcPapers.file}
      alt={kcPapers.alt}
      width={kcPapers.w}
      height={kcPapers.h}
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />

    <h3>{T(node('lifespan', 0).heading)}</h3>
    <p>
      {lifespanCell} — the Staffordshire Bull Terrier Club's figure, and the same one our breed
