    </p>
    <h5>{T('The Parents Are The Part We Control')}</h5>
    <p>Screening decides what a litter starts with; the years after that belong to your house.</p>
    <h6>{T('Health Note: Weight is the lever')}</h6>
    <p>Of everything an owner decides, it is the one most reliably tied to how long a Staffy lives.</p>
  </section>

  {/* 13 paperwork-review — reviews, picked style S3 as the BED and as the MODE (the block
