  {/* 15 talk-to-us — standard, NO PICK, and the close. The two locked prices and the refundable
      deposit, read out of data/price-matrix.json rather than typed; the old £850 to £1,200 band
      is not restated anywhere on this page (`dropped.prices`, Known Issue 11). The H2 and the
